Grayswandir's hallucination resistance doesn't work in the same way as
these resistances, no. It works in the same way as the protection of
the Eyes of the Overworld against blinding: _masking_ the effect, not
preventing its taking place. Think of it as Grayswandir letting you
see straight _even though_ you're hallucinating.

